  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CDTY Development and Peace Office Construction</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Catholic Diocese of Tombura Yambio Development and Peace Office (diocesan Caritas) suffers from a serious shortage of office space with staff scattered across diocesan buildings. This undermines internal communications, constrains the development of an organisational identity and creates a very difficult working environment (this affects 3 CAFOD staff who are based with the diocese). The DPO will build an office for 40 staff at the &quot;CRS Compound&quot; which has recently been returned to diocesan ownership. Various Caritas Member Organisations will contribute to construction costs.</narrative>
  </description>
